  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kader Project Support 2022-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kader Projektst&#xf6;d 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Women are more engaged and demanding towards equal representation of women in decision making positions, specifically in the politics.

Output 1.1: Women (who attended political schools and engaged with KA-DER in various contexts) are empowered and improved their capacities concerning equal representation of women in decision making, specifically in politics.

Output 1.2: Enhanced institutional capacity of KA.DER by strengthening its competencies in various fields.

Outcome 2: Stakeholders (engaged with KADERs work) are adopting a supporting approach towards engagement &amp; participation of women as candidates/key roles regarding central elections in 2023.

Output 2.1: Information on the state of women&apos;s participation and equal representation in Turkey became available via monitoring.

Output 2.2: Increased awareness of stakeholders (political parties, media etc.) potential voters regarding the political participation and representation of women.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets syfte &#xe4;r att skapa en positiv p&#xe5;verkan p&#xe5; starkare krav p&#xe5; j&#xe4;mlikt deltagande i alla beslutsfattande mekanismer med en j&#xe4;mlik representation av kvinnor inom alla omr&#xe5;den i det sociala livet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to create a positive impact towards stronger demand about equal participation in all decision-making mechanisms with the equal representation of women in all areas of social life.</narrative>
  </description>
